OL,3,APrince Harry says he would rejoin army
OL,4,Aas he warns of Russia threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex, who carried out a
OL,7,Fsurprise visit to Ukraine at the
OL,8,Fweekend, has said he would rejoin the
OL,9,Fmilitary if asked, as he warned of the
OL,10,Fthreat from Russia.
OL,12,FHe told the Telegraph he thought people
OL,13,Fwere right to be nervous in the current
OL,14,Finternational political climate and
OL,15,Fsaid it was time to "double our
OL,16,Fsupport" for Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
