OL,3,APrince Harry says he would rejoin army
OL,4,Aas he warns of Russia threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere appeared to be warnings about
OL,7,FPresident Trump - with Prince Harry
OL,8,Fsaying there was a big separation
OL,9,Fbetween what the American public thinks
OL,10,Fabout Ukraine and the administration's
OL,11,Fattitude.
OL,13,FPrince Harry, able to speak more freely
OL,14,Fthan working royals, said he hoped
OL,15,Fafter the US mid-term elections it
OL,16,Fwould be "fantastic to have more
OL,17,FAmerican support" for Ukraine.
